{% block content %}<div class="election-guide">
<p>Independent public-information guide for the Township of Sables-Spanish Rivers, including Massey, Webbwood, Walford and the rural township. Election day is <strong>October 26, 2026</strong>. Online voting is open and closes at <strong>8 pm Eastern</strong> that day. <a href="https://www.sables-spanish.ca/2026-municipal-elections/">Township election page</a>; <a href="https://www.sables-spanish.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/VOTE-ONLINE-Information-Flyer-2026.pdf">Township voting information flyer</a>.</p>
<p><strong>Research checked October 19, 2026.</strong> The official list contains two candidates for mayor and thirteen for councillor. Dated campaign material and meeting recordings have now been added. Coverage remains uneven, and comparisons are on hold. This guide makes no endorsement. A missing profile answer means information is still being gathered, not that a candidate has no position or declined to answer. <a href="https://www.sables-spanish.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Official-Candidates-List-2026.png">certified candidate list, August 24</a>.</p>
<div class="election-at-a-glance" aria-label="Election at a glance"><div><strong>26 October</strong><span>Voting closes at 8 pm Eastern</span></div><div><strong>15 candidates</strong><span>2 for mayor · 13 for councillor</span></div><div><strong>4 recordings</strong><span>Hear the meetings in context</span></div></div><nav class="election-jump" aria-label="Election guide sections"><a href="#candidates">Candidates</a> <a href="#meetings">Meeting recordings</a> <a href="#recorded-votes">Recorded votes</a> <a href="#issues">Municipal issues</a> <a href="#submit">Submit a platform</a> <a href="#voting">Voting help</a> <a href="#method">Sources and corrections</a></nav>
<section id="candidates"><h2>Meet the candidates</h2>
<p>Open a profile for a short summary, original campaign links and the verified public record. Candidates remain in certified surname order within each office. A summary is not an endorsement or a complete platform.</p>
<p class="election-editor-note"><strong>How to read these profiles:</strong> campaign statements are attributed to their authors. They are distinct from independently checked records. No direct invitations have been sent by this project; missing information is not a refusal to respond. Facebook links may require sign-in.</p>
